{
  "title": "Ziyarat e Imam Husain (a)",
  "data": "اَللهُ اَكْبَرُ اَللهُ اَكْبَرُ\nALLAAHU AKBAR, ALLAAHU AKBAR\nAllah is the Most Great, Allah is the Most Great.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNA RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O son of Allah's Messenger.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ خَاتَمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nASSALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNA KHAATAMIN NABIYYEEN\nPeace be upon you, O son of the Seal of the Prophets.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ سَيِّدِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nASSALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNA SAYYIDIL MURSALEEN\nPeace be upon you, O son of the Chief of the Messengers.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ سَيِّدِ الْوَصِيِّيْنَ\nASSALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNA SAYYIDIL WASIYYEEN\nPeace be upon you, O son of the Chief of the Prophets' successors.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَبَا عَبْدِ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA ABAA A'BDILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Aba-Abdullah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُسَيْنَ بْنَ عَلِيٍّ\nASSALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA HUSAYNABNA A'LIYY\nPeace be upon you, O al-Husayn, son of Ali.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ فَاطِمَةَ سَيِّدَةِ نِسَآءِ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nASSALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNA FAATIMATA SAYYIDATI NISAAA'IL A'ALAMEEN\nPeace be upon you, O son of Fatimah, the doyenne of the women of the world.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ اللّٰهِ وَ ابْنَ وَلِيِّهٖ\nASSALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WALIYYALLAAHI WABNA WALIYYIH\nPeace be upon you, O saint of Allah and son of His saint.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَفِيَّ اللّٰهِ وَ ابْنَ صَفِيِّهٖ\nASSALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SAFIYYALLAAHI WABNA SAFIYYIH\nPeace be upon you, O chosen of Allah and son of His chosen.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ اللّٰهِ وَ ابْنَ حُجَّتِهٖ\nASSALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA HUJJATALLAAHI WABNA HUJJATIH\nPeace be upon you, O proof of Allah and son of His proof.",
  "merits": "To be recited on the Night & Day of the 1st of Rajab, the 15th of Rajab, and the 15th of Sha'ban."
}
